{
  "audio_file": "web_audiobook.mp3",
  "total_duration": 101.53,
  "title": "《海洋里的会发光的月亮贝壳》",
  "entries": [
    {
      "scene_id": 1,
      "text": "朵朵今年6岁，最爱做的事，就是趴在窗边想深海里的一颗珍珠的样子。",
      "speaker": "朵朵",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "start": 0.0,
      "dur": 6.936
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 1,
      "text": "这天夜里，朵朵在日记本的最后一页写下：“我想去看看深海。",
      "speaker": "朵朵",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "start": 7.216,
      "dur": 6.144
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 1,
      "text": "”没想到字刚写完，书桌上的小台灯轻轻晃了三下，一个巴掌大的光团从灯罩里钻了出来。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "start": 13.64,
      "dur": 8.616
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 1,
      "text": "“我是墨墨，光里住着的声音。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "start": 22.536,
      "dur": 3.144
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 1,
      "text": "”光团眨了眨，“你写下的愿望，我帮你实现一半，另一半，要你自己走。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "start": 25.96,
      "dur": 6.696
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 1,
      "text": "”",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "start": 32.936,
      "dur": 0.8
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 2,
      "text": "可是走到一半，意外发生了——洋流把小船推进了黑水沟。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "+4Hz",
      "start": 34.016,
      "dur": 5.016
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 2,
      "text": "四周安静得能听见心跳，墨墨的光也变得忽明忽暗。",
      "speaker": "墨墨",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "+4Hz",
      "start": 39.312,
      "dur": 4.608
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 2,
      "text": "“别怕，”朵朵深吸一口气，把声音放得又稳又慢，“我们先找一块能站住的地方。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "+4Hz",
      "start": 44.2,
      "dur": 6.432
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 2,
      "text": "”",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "+10%",
      "pitch": "+4Hz",
      "start": 50.912,
      "dur": 0.8
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 3,
      "text": "等待的时间里，朵朵有点想家了，鼻子酸酸的。",
      "speaker": "朵朵",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
      "rate": "-12%",
      "pitch": "-4Hz",
      "start": 51.992,
      "dur": 5.352
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 3,
      "text": "墨墨把光调得暖暖的：“害怕不丢人，害怕说明你在乎。",
      "speaker": "墨墨",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "rate": "-12%",
      "pitch": "-4Hz",
      "start": 57.624,
      "dur": 6.744
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 3,
      "text": "”朵朵想了想，从口袋里摸出出发时带的小东西，握在手心里，慢慢就不抖了。",
      "speaker": "朵朵",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
      "rate": "-12%",
      "pitch": "-4Hz",
      "start": 64.648,
      "dur": 8.088
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 4,
      "text": "深海的尽头，朵朵看到了那片只属于勇敢者的风景，风把笑声送出去很远。",
      "speaker": "朵朵",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "start": 73.016,
      "dur": 7.2
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 4,
      "text": "回家的路上，朵朵把一块会发光的月亮贝壳的故事讲给墨墨听，两个人约好下一次一起去更远的地方。",
      "speaker": "朵朵",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "start": 80.496,
      "dur": 9.408
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 4,
      "text": "那天晚上，日记本翻回最后一页，朵朵在愿望下面添了一行字：“原来分享与感恩，是自己一步一步走出来的。",
      "speaker": "朵朵",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "start": 90.184,
      "dur": 9.984
    },
    {
      "scene_id": 4,
      "text": "”",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "start": 100.448,
      "dur": 0.8
    }
  ],
